1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,620
Don't paste that contract into ChatGPT yet.

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:05,160
Why not? It's just a client contract.

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,360
With their name, their rates and your signature.

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,890
ChatGPT won't tell anyone.

5
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:13,840
On personal plans, chats can be used to train models.

6
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,470
There's a switch for that. Check it.

7
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:20,000
And if my boss says no AI with client stuff?

8
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,570
Then your boss wins. Company policy beats any setting.

9
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:25,770
So I'll remove the names first?

10
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:28,970
Names, numbers, anything you wouldn't email a stranger.

11
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:32,510
Side hustle 52: reading the contract before I paste it.

